From 183e8410c2442aeccd1480ee476ef2f76ae2d334 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:42:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat: office adapter for avatars, main Bot, computer
 phase and open

Adds src/adapter/grokbot-internals.ts, the one place for the app internals
Grok Bot Office uses beyond the upstream commands (seen in Grok Bot 0.78.1):
avatarShape/avatarColor on Bot-list rows, the mainAgent store, the Bot
computer phase, and the selection/desktop stores to show a conversation.

- bots --json adds avatar, main and computerPhase (plain list if unreadable)
- open <bot>: select the conversation and focus the window, on request only
- internals: which pieces the running app still exposes
- bun test: the adapter's page code against a fake 0.78.1 renderer
