 {"type":"idle","bot":"Chief","at":"2026-10-19T04:40:33.275Z"}
 ```
 
+### Office adapter (this fork)
+
+This fork adds what [Grok Bot Office](https://github.com/swissmarley/grok-bot-office) needs, with every app store and field name in `src/adapter/grokbot-internals.ts`:
+
+- `grokbot bots --json` also gives each Bot's `avatar` (`shape`, `color`, `hasPhoto`), whether it is the `main` Bot, and the Bot computer's `computerPhase`. If the adapter can't read them, the plain list still works.
+- `grokbot open <bot>` shows that Bot's conversation and brings Grok Bot to the front, like clicking it in the sidebar. Focusing the window wakes the Bot's computer, so use it only when the user asks.
+- `grokbot internals` reports which of these pieces the current app version still exposes (`--json` for scripts).
+
+`bun test` runs the adapter against a fake renderer shaped like Grok Bot 0.78.1.
+
 ## Use it from your agent
 
 ### MCP (Claude Code, Cursor, Codex and others)
